ValidateOperandModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Validates a single operand: kind must be admissible (ValidOperandKind: ref/const/global/null). Returns 1 on success, 0 otherwise.
    Provides: ValidateOperand(operand) -> ok.
    DependsOn: ValidOperandKind.
    Composition: Native Include from modules/Compiler/Compiler.sir (Path: ../ValidateOperand/ValidateOperand.sir).
